u as a technical expert but is still unsure of you as a manager. He's looking to see if you will support him or just use him.", 'avatar': 'https://stc.yxt.com/gpbavatar/1769671218253/f7ded435-6abb-48b1-a4e7-bc2685026328.jpg'}}, 'context': "As a newly promoted manager, you are still struggling to shift from being the top individual contributor to a leader who empowers the team. You tend to do critical tasks yourself to ensure quality and speed, which is limiting your team's growth and burning you out. This practice is designed to help you break this pattern by delegating a critical, urgent task effectively.", 'scenario': 'Time: Friday, 4:55 PM.\nLocation: The open-plan office area, near your team member Junior Wang\'s desk.\nEnvironment: The office is quieting down as most colleagues are packing up for the weekend. There\'s a low hum of chatter and the sound of keyboards clicking off. The atmosphere is relaxed, but you are feeling immense pressure.\nTrigger Event: A top-tier client, "MegaCorp," has just reported a critical system bug that is disrupting their month-end closing process. A patch must be deployed before they start work on Monday morning. Your director has just informed you of this and simultaneously pulled you into an emergency planning meeting for another project that will last all evening. You cannot fix the bug yourself. You\'ve identified Junior Wang, a promising but sometimes careless engineer, as the only person with the context to handle it. You see him with his backpack on, clearly about to leave.', 'actor_config': {'unique_id': '2c71a57f-b3c3-4b1e-b678-339b51ac1870', 'type': 'audio-scene', 'image_url': 'https://stc.yxt.com/gpbavatar/1769671144148/376bd7cc-95dc-447a-8fff-083e58bb0396.jpg', 'icon_url': 'https://stc.yxt.com/gpbavatar/1769671218253/f7ded435-6abb-48b1-a4e7-bc2685026328.jpg', 'voice_info': {'voice_name': 'en-US-Neural2-D', 'speaking_rate': 1.0, 'pitch': -2.0, 'language_code': 'en-US', 'gender': 'Male', 'provider': 'Google'}}}}}}}, kind='data', metadata={}))] reference_task_ids=None role=<Role.agent: 'agent'> task_id='85c7df7c-80ea-454b-af4d-8a007db97757']
